<title>SWITZERLAND: Nokia's Maillefer cuts dividend.</title>
<headline>Nokia's Maillefer cuts dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia affiliate Maillefer Holding SA said it would propose reducing the dividend to nine Swiss francs per bearer share from 17.10.</p>
<p>The cable systems producer based in Ecublens, Lausanne, said the cut would be proposed at the next shareholders meeting on April 29.</p>
</text>
